sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente (Web)
    participant A as API (Fastify)
    participant S as StayService
    participant R as RateEngine
    participant DB as Base de Datos (Prisma)

    C->>A: POST /api/stays/check-in
    A->>S: checkIn(data)
    S->>R: selectRateForRoom()
    R-->>S: Tarifa aplicada
    S->>DB: Iniciar Transacción
    DB->>DB: Crear Registro Stay
    DB->>DB: Crear Cargo Inicial
    DB->>DB: Actualizar Habitación a OCCUPIED
    S->>DB: Commit Transacción
    S->>A: Evento Realtime (Socket.io)
    A-->>C: 201 Created (Check-in exitoso)
